<p>Notes to Financial Statements:</p>
<p>(1) The Company calculated funds from operations (FFO) in accordance with the white paper published by the National Association of Real Estate Investment Trusts, Inc. (NAREIT).</p>
<p>Funds from operations means net income (loss), (computed in accordance with generally accepted accounting principles), excluding gains (or losses) from debt restructuring and sales of property, plus depreciation and amortization relating to real property and after adjustment from unconsolidated partnerships and joint ventures.</p>
<p>(2) Includes $281 and $748 for straight-line rents for the three and nine month periods ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(3) The weighted average number of common shares outstanding was calculated as if the Class B Convertible Preferred stock had been converted into Meridian Industrial Trust common shares.</p>
<p>(4) Excludes square footage for build-to-suit properties in progress.</p>
